# Stein debris: a limestone chip of a shattered rock (lit i, m side, d
# shadow, k outline), the counterpart of the brick `debris`. spin = the chip
# tumbles between two shapes, lit edge kept top left.
sprite = stein_debris
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
hitbox = 1,1,6,6
anim   = spin frames=2 ticks=4 loop
---
frame spin 0
..kkk...
.kiimk..
kiiimmk.
kimmddk.
.kdddk..
..kkk...
........
........
frame spin 1
..kk....
.kiikk..
.kiimmk.
.kimmdk.
..kmddk.
...kdk..
....k...
........
